update_rule.pseudocode:
introduce external_importations_per_day random infections
for each Person i determine daily contacts C_i by Poisson(contact_rate_base * modifier_by_location * mobility_factor(i))
for each contact pair (i,j) at location type L:
  p_transmit_base <- base_transmission_prob_per_contact * location_contact_rate_modifier_L
  mask_factor <- (1 - mask_efficacy_source_control)^(mask_status(i)) * (1 - mask_efficacy_wearer_protection)^(mask_status(j))
  p_transmit <- p_transmit_base * mask_factor
  if i infectious and j susceptible and rand() < p_transmit: infect j (after incubation_period_days)
progress disease states (exposed->infectious->recovered) with incubation_period_days and infectious_period_days
isolate symptomatic with prob symptom_isolation_probability (reduce mobility)
estimate Rt via ratio of new infections to infectious persons and generation time proxy
